<title>USA: Sport Supply could suffer from UPS strike.</title>
<headline>Sport Supply could suffer from UPS strike.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sport Supply Group Inc said Tuesday that a prolonged strike against United Parcel Service by the Teamsters union could have a material adverse effect on its results.</p>
<p>The company said a significant portion of its orders are generally shipped by UPS. It said it has obtained some alternative freight carriers, but that it cannot be certain that these carriers can handle its present volume of orders.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610)).</p>
</text>
